<title>POLAND: ZASADA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZASADA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.67 vs   0.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.55 vs   1.17 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.60 vs   2.66</p>
<p> Sales		   23.27 vs  21.82</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.11 vs   9.98</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.39 vs  15.34</p>
<p> Operating profit    21.37 vs  32.85</p>
<p> Sales		  347.55 vs 277.99</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish automotive group is Sobieslaw</p>
<p>Zasada Centrum SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
